issues.description:
File: `tests/unit/qr-generator-dithered-scan-gate.spec.ts`

This file has two tests that time out in CI. Increase their timeouts.

**Change 1** (around line 662): Find the closing of the first scan-gate test:

```
  }, 15000);
```

Change to:

```
  }, 30000);
```

**Change 2**: Find the closing of the second scan-gate test (the last `});` before the final suite closing). If it has a timeout, increase it to 30000. If it has no timeout, add `, 30000` before the closing `);`.

Validate: `npx vitest run tests/unit/qr-generator-dithered-scan-gate.spec.ts`

